      "method": "Score 0 to 100 from four readings, each scaled 0 to 1: where the index sits in its 3-month range (30%), its 7-day move (25%, ±4% is the full scale), today's move (15%, ±1.5%), and the volatility index inverted within its own 3-month range (30%; calm is high). Below 25 Fearful, 25 to 44 Cautious, 45 to 55 Neutral, 56 to 74 Confident, 75 and above Exuberant."
    },
